### SUMMARY OF KEY FINDINGS

| Concern in ticket | What the docs say |
|---|---|
| "No code changes needed?" | **No.** Link 1 requires SDK installation, JS initialization, and per-page `onEntryChange()` wiring. Code + config both required. |
| "Works only from Visual Experience tab?" | Link 1 says the Live Preview icon appears "within all the entries." If it doesn't, that's a bug — consistent with the ticket's TBD. |
| "Links won't work in Live Preview?" | Link 2 shows Custom Preview URLs can handle nested/dynamic routing via configuration. Default behavior is simple base-URL + URL-field. |
| SDK callback signature | `onEntryChange(updateData)` — takes a function argument. |
| CSR vs SSR | Link 1 is explicitly CSR (`ssr: false`). If the codeline is SSR or hybrid, a different guide is needed. |
| Configuration location | Both docs confirm configuration is in Contentstack UI: Settings > Environments (base URLs) and Visual Experience (Live Preview enable, Preview URL patterns). |

